@!internal
module nupp.tools

--[[
The tools built on Nupp's compiler: the command line, the build system and project
model, the language server, the formatter, documentation, and the rest of what
`nupp` does beyond compiling.

This namespace is not part of the language's public library surface. The leading
inner annotation keeps this module and every `nupp.tools.*` descendant out of public
API documentation while still allowing private documentation builds to inspect it.

The dependency runs one way. A tool may use anything in `nupp.compiler`; no
`nupp.compiler` module may reach back into here.
]]

export = {}
